          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jaune : au tiroir": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yellow: to the drawer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'aperçu montre l'image et le titre du site : pour cela, Side contacte le site du lien, seulement quand le volet l'affiche. La présentation vaut pour le presse-papiers comme pour l'onglet « Enregistrés ». Les liens enregistrés restent sur ce Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The preview shows the site's image and title: to do this, Side contacts the link's website, only when the panel shows it. The appearance applies to both the clipboard and the Saved tab. Saved links stay on this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'historique du copier-coller est désactivé dans les réglages de Side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clipboard history is turned off in Side's settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'écran derrière la carte s'estompe en fondu. On peut toujours cliquer et glisser des fichiers au travers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The screen behind the card fades out. You can still click and drag files through it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'élément qu'elle contient sera supprimé définitivement. Cette action est irréversible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The item it contains will be deleted permanently. You can't undo this action."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La carte apparaît au centre. Tire-la par sa barre du haut pour la déplacer : Side retient l'endroit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The card appears in the center. Drag it by its top bar to move it: Side remembers the spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La case « + » range une application dans le tiroir : elle y reste, à portée de main.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The “+” tile puts an app in the drawer: it stays there, within reach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La connexion n'a pas abouti. Vous pouvez fermer cette page et réessayer depuis le panneau.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection didn’t go through. You can close this page and try again from the drawer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La grille": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Grid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La liste des applications s'ouvre toujours du côté intérieur de l'écran, avec sa pointe dirigée vers le Dock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app list always opens toward the inside of the screen, with its arrow pointing at the Dock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La musique et les petites applis : un coup d'œil, et on referme.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Music and small apps: take a quick look, then close it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La note « %@ » est introuvable dans Notes : renommée ou supprimée. Retire sa tuile et choisis-la de nouveau avec le +.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The note “%@” can't be found in Notes: it was renamed or deleted. Remove its tile and choose it again with the + button."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La page de Spotify s'ouvre dans votre navigateur…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Spotify page is opening in your browser…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La roue dentée, sous la case « + », ouvre les réglages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The gear, below the “+” tile, opens Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La rubrique « Dossiers récents » montre les derniers dossiers où tu as travaillé, en grille.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The “Recent Folders” section shows the last folders you worked in, as a grid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La touche choisie avec un chiffre de 1 à 9 mène droit à l'application de ce numéro dans « Mes applications », puis aux autres fenêtres dans l'ordre des cases de la grille. Attention : ces raccourcis sont alors pris à toutes les applications. ⌘ + chiffre sert par exemple à changer d'onglet dans Safari ou de présentation dans le Finder ; ⌃ + chiffre n'est presque jamais utilisé.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The chosen key with a number from 1 to 9 goes straight to the app with that number in “My apps”, then to the other windows in the order of the grid tiles. Note: these shortcuts are then taken from every app. ⌘ + number is used, for example, to switch tabs in Safari or views in the Finder; ⌃ + number is almost never used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La touche choisie avec un chiffre de 1 à 9 mène droit à la fenêtre de ce numéro, dans l'ordre des cases de la grille (le numéro s'affiche au survol d'une case). Attention : ces raccourcis sont alors pris à toutes les applications. ⌘ + chiffre sert par exemple à changer d'onglet dans Safari ou de présentation dans le Finder ; ⌃ + chiffre n'est presque jamais utilisé.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The chosen key with a number from 1 to 9 goes straight to the window with that number, in the order of the grid's tiles (the number appears when you hover over a tile). Note: these shortcuts are then taken from all other apps. For example, ⌘ + number switches tabs in Safari or views in the Finder; ⌃ + number is almost never used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La vidéo est en plein écran": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The video is full screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La vidéo remplit la tuile (ou reprend sa place)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The video fills the tile (or goes back to its place)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La visite guidée de Side, en sept étapes": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The guided tour of Side, in seven steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La zone de dépôt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Drop Zone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Laisser les dossiers en haut lors du tri par nom": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep folders on top when sorting by name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lancer « %@ ». Dépose un fichier pour le lui passer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run “%@”. Drop a file to pass it along."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Langue": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Largeur (sans les colonnes épinglées)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Width (without pinned columns)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Largeur d'une colonne": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Column width"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Largeur du tiroir": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drawer Width"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Largeur du volet": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Panel width"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Dock": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Dock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Dock affiché dans la grille.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Dock shown in the grid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Finder arrive": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Finder comes in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Finder de Side : d'où il arrive, sa taille, son fond.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Side's Finder: where it comes from, its size, its background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Finder n'a pas répondu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Finder didn't respond."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Finder par-dessus tout, tes apps de travail en grand, les petites apps dans le tiroir.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Finder on top of everything, your work apps full screen, small apps in the drawer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Finder se ferme toujours avec le raccourci clavier, la touche Échap, une secousse ou en revenant dans le coin actif.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Finder always closes with the keyboard shortcut, the Escape key, a shake, or by going back to the hot corner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le Finder sur le côté, tes apps de travail en grand, les petites apps dans le tiroir.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Finder on the side, your work apps full screen, small apps in the drawer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le bouton jaune range une app dans le tiroir. Dans le tiroir, le bouton vert la ressort au centre de l'écran.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The yellow button puts an app away in the drawer. In the drawer, the green button takes it back out, to the center of the screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le bouton jaune range une app dans le tiroir. ⌃⌥↑ la remet en grand, ⌃⌥↓ la renvoie au tiroir.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The yellow button puts an app away in the drawer. ⌃⌥↑ brings it back full screen, ⌃⌥↓ sends it to the drawer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le bouton lecture l'ouvre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The play button opens it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le bouton vert": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Green Button"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le bouton vert remplit l'écran": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The green button fills the screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le coin %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The %@ corner"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le coin qui affiche la grille se choisit avec les autres coins actifs : Finder, tiroir, presse-papiers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The corner that shows the grid is chosen along with the other hot corners: Finder, drawer, clipboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le compte Spotify n'est pas connecté.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Spotify account isn’t connected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le dernier dossier consulté": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last folder viewed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le dossier de départ et les colonnes épinglées du Finder de Side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The starting folder and the pinned columns of Side's Finder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le geste dans l'autre sens referme le Finder. Attention : macOS utilise déjà ces gestes, vers le haut pour Mission Control et vers le bas pour « Exposé des apps ». Pour que les deux ne se déclenchent pas ensemble, mets-les sur « Désactivé » dans Réglages Système > Trackpad > Autres gestes. Side ne change pas ces réglages lui-même.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swiping the other way closes the Finder. Note: macOS already uses these gestures, up for Mission Control and down for App Exposé. So that both don't trigger together, set them to “Off” in System Settings > Trackpad > More Gestures. Side doesn't change these settings itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le même fond flou sert au Finder de Side, au volet du presse-papiers et aux onglets du coin multimédia du tiroir : cette opacité vaut pour tous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same blurred background is used by Side's Finder, the clipboard panel and the media tabs in the drawer: this opacity applies to all of them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le plein écran": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le plus simple : le bouton jaune d'une application l'envoie au tiroir, et le bouton vert d'une application du tiroir la remet en plein écran (Option + clic : le comportement habituel de macOS). Aussi au clic droit sur une case de la grille, et dans la liste du « + » du tiroir.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The simplest way: an app's yellow button sends it to the drawer, and the green button of a drawer app makes it full screen again (Option-click keeps macOS's usual behavior). Also by right-clicking a grid tile, and in the drawer's “+” list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le port 8765 du Mac est déjà pris. Fermez l'application qui l'utilise et réessayez.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port 8765 on this Mac is already in use. Quit the app using it and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le presse-papiers": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Clipboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Drawer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir arrive": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drawer comes in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir arrive du bas de l'écran : son geste est quatre doigts %@. Il n'est libre que si le Finder s'ouvre, lui, avec quatre doigts « Vers le bas ».": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drawer comes in from the bottom of the screen: its gesture is four fingers %@. It's only available if the Finder itself opens with four fingers “Down”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir arrive du bas de l'écran, à l'opposé du Finder : quatre doigts %@ l'ouvrent, dans l'autre sens le referment. Il suit les doigts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drawer comes in from the bottom of the screen, opposite the Finder: four fingers %@ open it, the other way closes it. It follows your fingers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir arrive du haut de l'écran : son geste est quatre doigts %@. Il n'est libre que si le Finder s'ouvre, lui, avec quatre doigts « Vers le haut ».": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drawer comes in from the top of the screen: its gesture is four fingers %@. It's only available if the Finder itself opens with four fingers “Up”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir arrive du haut de l'écran, à l'opposé du Finder : quatre doigts %@ l'ouvrent, dans l'autre sens le referment. Il suit les doigts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drawer comes in from the top of the screen, opposite the Finder: four fingers %@ open it, the other way closes it. It follows your fingers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir montre une seule application ; prolonge le geste à quatre doigts pour passer aux autres.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drawer shows a single app; keep the four-finger swipe going to move to the others."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir prend toujours le bord opposé au Finder : du haut quand le Finder vient du bas, du bas dans tous les autres cas. Le geste à quatre doigts s'inverse avec lui.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drawer always takes the edge opposite the Finder: from the top when the Finder comes from the bottom, from the bottom in all other cases. The four-finger gesture flips with it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tiroir, second panneau de Side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The drawer, Side's second panel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le volet": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Panel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le volet de droite : ce que tu as copié, et les liens que tu gardes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The right-hand panel: what you've copied, and the links you keep."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le volet glisse depuis le bord droit de l'écran": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The panel slides in from the right edge of the screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lecteurs affichés": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Players Shown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lecture": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Now Playing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lecture / pause": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play / Pause"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les %lld éléments qu'elle contient seront supprimés définitivement. Cette action est irréversible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The %lld items it contains will be deleted permanently. You can't undo this action."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les applications de travail remplissent l'écran, sans le plein écran d'Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Work apps fill the screen, without Apple's full screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les applications du tiroir y gardent leur place : elles ne sont jamais agrandies. Leur liste se règle dans Réglages > Tiroir > Applications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drawer apps keep their place in the drawer: they are never enlarged. Their list is set in Settings > Drawer > Apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les applications rangées dans le tiroir.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The apps kept in the drawer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les boutons et les gestes de la souris MX Master, sans le logiciel de Logitech.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The buttons and gestures of the MX Master mouse, without Logitech’s software."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les cartes suivent les doigts": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cards follow fingers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les deux": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les en sortir": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take Them Out"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les parties de Side": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The parts of Side"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les petites applications et la musique, une à la fois.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Small apps and music, one at a time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les textes, les fichiers et les 40 dernières images copiés sont gardés 7 jours sur ce Mac ; ce que tu épingles (clic droit) est gardé sans limite. Les mots de passe ne sont jamais écrits sur le disque. Décocher l'historique efface tout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copied text, files and the last 40 images are kept for 7 days on this Mac; what you pin (right-click) is kept with no limit. Passwords are never written to disk. Turning off history erases everything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les zones où poser des fichiers en attente, à côté du Finder de Side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The zones where you can leave files waiting, next to Side's Finder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lien": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lien ou texte à coller": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Link or text to paste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liens": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Links"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liens enregistrés": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved Links"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lire les informations": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get Info"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liste": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "List"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Masquer cette app": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide This App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Masquer le bouton Apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide the Apps Button"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Masquer le mini-Dock": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide the Mini Dock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Masquer les Shorts": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide Shorts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Masquer les Shorts retire leurs rangées, leur onglet et les vidéos courtes, tout de suite. Couper les publicités est contraire aux conditions d'utilisation de YouTube : à activer en connaissance de cause, pris en compte au prochain lancement de Side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide Shorts removes their rows, their tab and short videos, right away. Blocking ads goes against YouTube's terms of service: turn it on knowingly; it takes effect the next time Side launches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mes applications": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "My apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Milieu": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Middle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mini-Dock": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mini Dock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Modifier le lien": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
